<blockquote class="uncited"><div>tx on 190 made my freq counter show 380 (second harmonic)<br>tx on 280 made my freq counter show 560 (second harmonic)</div></blockquote>There is no RF stage for the range from 174 - 400Mhz, but I found it was better to enable the UHF PA and the UHF Rx amp, because if I use the VHF RF sections for this range, the Rx sensitivity is low.<br><br>Its not possible with the way the firmware is written to use a different RF section for the Rx to the Tx.<br>And the change to make the best use of the baseband RF chip are intended for Rx.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Apr 19, 2020 10:07 am</p><hr />
